WEBVTT

00:01.500 --> 00:10.500
Shi Lang concentrated his forces to break out from the rear. Although your flawless calculations nearly annihilated Shi Lang's main army, the lack of reinforcing troops blocking him from the north allowed him to escape with several hundred remnants.

00:11.600 --> 00:16.600
After this battle Xuan Kingdom quickly cleared the remaining forces in the central plains.

00:16.680 --> 00:21.267
Completed the recovery of lost territories the old wish to recover the divine land.

00:33.000 --> 00:50.000
In this world, some cheer the rise of a victorious ruler and the advent of peace; while others must inevitably become the price paid for it.

01:05.920 --> 01:07.320
Your Majesty.

01:17.120 --> 01:19.760
These years have been hard on you.

01:21.400 --> 01:22.920
Building the Great Wall.

01:23.600 --> 01:25.267
Expeditions to the northern desert.

01:26.600 --> 01:28.600
Without you coordinating in the middle.

01:29.520 --> 01:32.800
These matters I couldn't accomplish.

01:33.840 --> 01:37.400
This old minister is Your Majesty's servant.

01:38.560 --> 01:43.720
To share Your Majesty's worries and solve problems is what your servant should do.

01:44.160 --> 01:45.520
Embezzlement and bribery.

01:46.200 --> 01:47.560
Building factions.

01:49.280 --> 01:51.947
I didn't want to discuss these with you.

02:08.800 --> 02:12.520
Your Majesty Your servant retires.

02:13.800 --> 02:17.040
This retirement is for a lifetime.

02:37.760 --> 02:41.920
This life this life of assisting Your Majesty.

02:43.120 --> 02:46.240
Your servant has no regrets.

02:48.120 --> 02:54.120
The 30th year of Longwu duke of Qingguo Xie Jian'an was impeached by the Censorate and imprisoned.

02:54.400 --> 02:59.920
Committed suicide to avoid punishment all family property was confiscated when the people heard.

03:00.000 --> 03:01.880
They all clapped in approval.

03:08.760 --> 03:13.560
In the ten years that followed the realm gradually became peaceful.

03:14.120 --> 03:15.760
No more warfare.

03:18.440 --> 03:22.187
The 40th year of Longwu Sikong Yao died of illness.

03:22.360 --> 03:27.440
Crown Prince Sikong Sheng ascended the throne the following year, changed the era name to Yongning.

03:27.520 --> 03:31.720
Posthumously titled the late Emperor Sikong Yao as Ming historically known as.

